# --- consolidated in-repo data (not source) -------------------------------
# The Lean project lives here now, not ~/proofs: it holds Proofs/Verified.lean,
# the accumulated lemma library. Its .lake tree is 7.4 GB of Mathlib source and
# build artifacts -- rebuildable, never committed.
lean/.lake/
lean/build/
# Built retrieval indexes: ~1 GB of vectors, rebuildable from Mathlib in ~15
# min per embedder (python3 -m src.mathlib_kb --build).
kb/*.npy
kb/corpus.jsonl
# Learned search state. Rebuildable in principle but expensive to relearn;
# ignored because it is per-machine, not shared.
kb/archive.json
kb/bandit.json
kb/evolve.json
# Lean scratch files the REPL leaves behind.
lean/tmp*.lean
# Per-machine run logs and learned state, same class as kb/archive.json above.
traces/
kb/library.json
kb/plans.json
kb/meta.json
# Formalizer training sets: rebuilt by evals/formalize_dataset.py and
# evals/fetch_public_pairs.py. v3 is 137 MB, over GitHub's file limit.
kb/formalize_sft*
